VALUES ('两数之和','## 题目描述

给定一个整数数组 `nums` 和一个整数目标值 `target`，请找出数组中和为目标值的两个不同元素，并返回它们的下标。

每组数据保证恰好存在一个答案，同一个元素不能重复使用。下标从 `0` 开始，按升序输出两个下标。

## ACM 模式输入

第一行包含两个整数 `n` 和 `target`。第二行包含 `n` 个整数，表示数组 `nums`。

## ACM 模式输出

输出两个用空格分隔的下标。

## 核心代码模式

实现 `Solution.twoSum(nums: int[], target: int) -> int[]`。

## 数据范围

- `2 ≤ n ≤ 10^5`
- `-10^9 ≤ nums[i], target ≤ 10^9`','["简单","数组","哈希表"]','使用哈希表记录已经访问过的值及其下标。遍历到 nums[i] 时查找 target-nums[i]，找到后返回两个下标。时间复杂度 O(n)，空间复杂度 O(n)。',0,0,'[{"input":"4 9\\n2 7 11 15\\n","output":"0 1\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"3 6\\n3 2 4\\n","output":"1 2\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"2 6\\n3 3\\n","output":"0 1\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"5 4\\n-1 0 2 5 3\\n","output":"0 3\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"6 11\\n1 2 3 4 6 8\\n","output":"2 5\\n","isHidden":true}]','{"timeLimit":2000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576}','{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"twoSum","parameters":[{"name":"nums","type":"int[]"},{"name":"target","type":"int"}],"returnType":"int[]","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT"},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[2,7,11,15],\\"target\\":9}","output":"[0,1]","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[3,2,4],\\"target\\":6}","output":"[1,2]","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[3,3],\\"target\\":6}","output":"[0,1]","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[-1,0,2,5,3],\\"target\\":4}","output":"[0,3]","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[1,2,3,4,6,8],\\"target\\":11}","output":"[2,5]","isHidden":true}]}',1,1,0,0,@admin_id,0,0,1);
