VALUES ('有效的括号','## 题目描述

给定一个只包含 `(`、`)`、`[`、`]`、`{`、`}` 的字符串，判断括号是否有效。

有效字符串必须满足：左括号由相同类型的右括号闭合，并且闭合顺序正确。

## ACM 模式输入

一行非空字符串 `s`。

## ACM 模式输出

有效输出 `true`，否则输出 `false`。

## 核心代码模式

实现 `Solution.isValid(s: string) -> boolean`。

## 数据范围

- `1 ≤ |s| ≤ 10^5`','["简单","字符串","栈"]','用栈保存尚未匹配的左括号。遇到右括号时，栈顶必须是对应的左括号；遍历结束后栈必须为空。时间复杂度 O(n)，空间复杂度 O(n)。',0,0,'[{"input":"()[]{}\\n","output":"true\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"(]\\n","output":"false\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"{[]}\\n","output":"true\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"([)]\\n","output":"false\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"((()))\\n","output":"true\\n","isHidden":true}]','{"timeLimit":2000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576}','{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"isValid","parameters":[{"name":"s","type":"string"}],"returnType":"boolean","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT"},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"()[]{}\\"}","output":"true","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"(]\\"}","output":"false","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"{[]}\\"}","output":"true","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"([)]\\"}","output":"false","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"((()))\\"}","output":"true","isHidden":true}]}',1,1,0,0,@admin_id,0,0,2);
