INSERT INTO question (title,content,tags,answer,submitNum,acceptedNum,judgeCase,judgeConfig,problemSpec,problemVersion,isPublished,thumbNum,favourNum,userId,isDelete,rowVersion,problemNo)
VALUES ('最大子数组和','## 题目描述

给定一个整数数组 `nums`，找出和最大的非空连续子数组，返回该子数组的元素和。

## ACM 模式输入

第一行是数组长度 `n`，第二行是 `n` 个整数。

## ACM 模式输出

输出最大连续子数组和。

## 核心代码模式

实现 `Solution.maxSubArray(nums: int[]) -> int`。

## 数据范围

- `1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5`
- `-10^4 ≤ nums[i] ≤ 10^4`','["中等","数组","动态规划"]','令 current 表示以当前位置结尾的最大子数组和，转移为 max(nums[i], current+nums[i])，同时维护全局最大值。时间复杂度 O(n)，空间复杂度 O(1)。',0,0,'[{"input":"9\\n-2 1 -3 4 -1 2 1 -5 4\\n","output":"6\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"1\\n1\\n","output":"1\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"5\\n5 4 -1 7 8\\n","output":"23\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"6\\n-8 -3 -6 -2 -5 -4\\n","output":"-2\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"5\\n0 -1 2 -3 4\\n","output":"4\\n","isHidden":true}]','{"timeLimit":2000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576}','{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"maxSubArray","parameters":[{"name":"nums","type":"int[]"}],"returnType":"int","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT"},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]}","output":"6","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[1]}","output":"1","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[5,4,-1,7,8]}","output":"23","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[-8,-3,-6,-2,-5,-4]}","output":"-2","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"nums\\":[0,-1,2,-3,4]}","output":"4","isHidden":true}]}',1,1,0,0,@admin_id,0,0,4);
